{"seq":2,"slug":"harmony-study","title":"和声学","stage":"DONE","category":"music-audio","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"和声学-简介\">和声学 简介</h1><p>和声（Harmony）是多个音同时发响时产生的纵向音响关系。如果说旋律是音乐的&quot;水平线条&quot;，和声就是支撑这条线条的&quot;垂直骨架&quot;。本 Hub 聚焦一件事：<strong>和弦如何构成、如何连接、如何写好声部</strong>——从巴洛克数字低音到当代爵士与非功能和声的完整逻辑链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 Hub 讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>和声学不是孤立的学科，它处在乐理与编曲之间。理解边界能帮你在正确的 Hub 里找正确的内容，避免重复学习：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>归属 Hub</th>\n<th>与本 Hub 的分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>音程、音阶、调式、转调、记谱</td>\n<td><a href=\"../music-theory-foundations/\">乐理基础</a></td>\n<td><strong>前置</strong>：和声学假设你已会读这些；本 Hub 不重讲音阶构成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和弦构成 / 进行 / 声部连接 / 现代和声</td>\n<td><strong>本 Hub</strong></td>\n<td>纵向音响关系与连接逻辑本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把和声分配给乐器、音域音色平衡、织体</td>\n<td><a href=\"../arrangement-orchestration/\">编曲与配器</a></td>\n<td><strong>下游</strong>：和声是&quot;写什么和弦&quot;，配器是&quot;谁来奏、怎么铺&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和弦的协和/泛音/频谱基础</td>\n<td><a href=\"../audio-signal-processing/\">音频信号处理</a></td>\n<td>声学解释（为何五度协和），本 Hub 只用结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>让 AI 生成和声进行</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-music-generation/\">AI 音乐生成</a></td>\n<td>模型与表示，本 Hub 提供其学习的&quot;和声语法&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>乐理给你音符，和声学教你把音符叠成和弦并连接成句，编曲再把和弦交给乐器。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 Hub 前，你应当已经掌握（否则先到 <a href=\"../music-theory-foundations/\">乐理基础</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>音程</strong>：能识别大小三度、纯五度、七度等——这是和弦叠置的原材料（见 <a href=\"../music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/intervals\">音程体系</a>）</li>\n<li><strong>大小调音阶</strong>：调内各级和弦的性质直接由音阶决定（见 <a href=\"../music-theory-foundations/scales-keys/major-minor-scales\">大小调音阶</a>）</li>\n<li><strong>调式与转调的基本概念</strong>：现代和声章节会频繁借用（见 <a href=\"../music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/modes-basics\">调式基础</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不需要任何乐器演奏基础，但强烈建议边学边在钢琴或 DAW 上弹奏每个和弦与进行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 Hub 四章呈递进关系，但不同人群可走不同路线：</p>\n<p><strong>作曲 / 编曲入门者（按顺序通读）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>第一章 <a href=\"chord-construction/triads\">和弦构建</a>：三和弦 → 七和弦 → 延伸和弦，建立&quot;和弦从哪来&quot;的直觉</li>\n<li>第二章 <a href=\"chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">和声进行</a>：功能和声 → 常用进行 → 和声节奏，学会把和弦连成句子</li>\n<li>第三章 <a href=\"voice-leading/voice-leading-principles\">声部连接</a>：把进行写成多声部、避开平行禁忌</li>\n<li>第四章 <a href=\"modern-harmony/jazz-harmony\">现代和声</a>：进阶色彩</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>流行 / 编曲速成者（最短可用路径）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接读 <a href=\"chord-construction/triads\">三和弦</a> + <a href=\"chord-construction/seventh-chords\">七和弦</a> → <a href=\"chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">功能和声</a> → <a href=\"chord-progressions/common-progressions\">常用进行</a>，即可写出主流流行作品的和声框架，需要时再补 <a href=\"modern-harmony/modal-interchange\">调式互换</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>爵士 / R&amp;B 方向</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>通读第一、二章后，重点攻第四章 <a href=\"modern-harmony/jazz-harmony\">爵士和声</a>（ii-V-I、三全音替代、voicing），并回看 <a href=\"chord-construction/extended-chords\">延伸和弦</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音乐分析 / 学术方向</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>第二章 <a href=\"chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">功能和声</a> + 第三章全章 + 第四章 <a href=\"modern-harmony/new-harmonic-language\">新和声语言</a>（Neo-Riemannian、非功能体系）是分析工具的核心</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"四章概览\">四章概览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章「<a href=\"chord-construction/triads\">和弦构建</a>」</strong>：三度叠置原理，三和弦、七和弦、延伸和弦的构成与标记系统。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章「<a href=\"chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">和声进行</a>」</strong>：功能和声三分法、终止式、常用进行套路、二次属和弦与和声节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章「<a href=\"voice-leading/voice-leading-principles\">声部连接</a>」</strong>：四部和声写作、平行五八度禁忌、非和弦音与对位入门。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章「<a href=\"modern-harmony/jazz-harmony\">现代和声</a>」</strong>：爵士和声体系、调式互换、印象派与 20 世纪非功能和声语言。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chord-construction","title":"和弦构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"triads","title":"三和弦的构成与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/triads"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seventh-chords","title":"七和弦体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/seventh-chords"},{"seq":3,"slug":"extended-chords","title":"延伸和弦与复杂结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/extended-chords"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"chord-progressions","title":"和声进行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"functional-harmony","title":"功能和声与进行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/functional-harmony"},{"seq":2,"slug":"common-progressions","title":"流行与古典常用和声进行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/common-progressions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"harmonic-rhythm","title":"和声节奏与曲式结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/harmonic-rhythm"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"voice-leading","title":"声部连接","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"voice-leading-principles","title":"声部连接原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/voice-leading-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-prohibition","title":"平行运动禁忌与对位基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/parallel-prohibition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"non-chord-tones","title":"非和弦音与装饰技法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/non-chord-tones"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-harmony","title":"现代和声","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"jazz-harmony","title":"爵士和声体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/jazz-harmony"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modal-interchange","title":"调式互换与借用和弦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/modal-interchange"},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-harmonic-language","title":"新和声语言与非功能体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/new-harmonic-language"}]}]}